WEBVTT

00:28.653 --> 00:29.571
SONG JOONSU

00:30.155 --> 00:31.823
Donghoon… No.

00:31.906 --> 00:33.783
Joonsu was undercover.

00:33.867 --> 00:35.660
SONG JOONSU,
INCHANG DRUG INVESTIGATION UNIT

00:35.744 --> 00:37.454
He was our agent…

00:46.921 --> 00:47.756
Hey.

00:52.802 --> 00:53.887
How's the Captain?

00:54.554 --> 00:55.972
He's still in surgery.

00:56.598 --> 00:58.099
For four hours now.

01:09.736 --> 01:11.404
I brought him home last night.

01:12.864 --> 01:15.575
He seemed nervous,
so I offered to stay, but he said no.

01:18.453 --> 01:22.040
I'm sure it's Choi Mujin's fault,
but I don't know why.

01:23.750 --> 01:25.251
Why go after the Captain?

01:28.004 --> 01:29.422
We'll catch the guy.

01:30.006 --> 01:31.341
Captain shot him.

01:32.092 --> 01:34.636
We found blood and fingerprints
at the scene.

01:40.391 --> 01:41.643
Why do you look so pale?

01:45.188 --> 01:46.564
I didn't get to sleep much.

01:50.443 --> 01:51.444
Hey.

01:52.362 --> 01:53.655
It didn't record?

01:54.823 --> 01:56.991
Get all the surveillance videos
from nearby.

01:57.075 --> 01:58.118
Okay. I'll go too.

02:06.543 --> 02:08.628
The surgery went well.

02:08.711 --> 02:11.047
We'll move him to the ICU
and monitor him. Don't worry.

02:17.262 --> 02:18.930
Cha Giho survived.

02:19.013 --> 02:20.265
I'm sorry.

02:24.769 --> 02:27.355
Jiwoo was there at the scene.

02:28.606 --> 02:30.400
She may have discovered the truth.

02:31.359 --> 02:32.694
We have to kill her.

03:50.813 --> 03:51.648
Captain.

04:14.963 --> 04:17.715
What would you do
if you found your sister's killer?

04:18.967 --> 04:20.551
You find him and there's no…

04:22.971 --> 04:24.264
No evidence?

04:26.307 --> 04:27.934
We'll get Choi Mujin.

04:28.768 --> 04:30.645
We'll do it while he's still rattled.

04:39.445 --> 04:42.031
You should stay put
for the time being.

04:42.115 --> 04:45.201
The police are after you
for Gangjae's murder.

05:04.512 --> 05:06.139
She wants to get revenge.

05:09.642 --> 05:10.643
Let her.

06:47.949 --> 06:50.993
JEON PILDO

07:36.122 --> 07:37.623
Die, bitch!

08:16.287 --> 08:17.497
I told you

08:18.831 --> 08:19.957
it was foolish.

08:23.669 --> 08:25.046
You're a traitor's daughter,

08:25.129 --> 08:27.632
but you came to us
and said you'll kill the culprit.

08:29.008 --> 08:30.384
When I served Donghoon,

08:30.468 --> 08:32.261
I got to know him very well.

08:32.845 --> 08:34.514
He didn't belong in this line of work.

08:39.810 --> 08:42.897
So how does it feel to be a clueless pawn?

08:53.115 --> 08:55.034
It was you who killed my dad, right?

08:56.244 --> 08:58.412
Oh, I wanted to be the one who killed him.

09:01.123 --> 09:03.543
You've never ever seen
the real Choi Mujin.

09:07.088 --> 09:10.716
If you backstabbed him,
he'll make you pay personally.

09:12.885 --> 09:15.805
He enjoys watching them take
their final breath.

09:18.724 --> 09:20.685
I wonder how your father looked.

09:23.479 --> 09:25.147
How will you look when you die?

09:27.358 --> 09:28.693
How about we find out?

11:13.422 --> 11:15.841
Do you assholes really think
that you're human?

11:16.634 --> 11:17.885
What about…

11:19.303 --> 11:20.262
you?

11:21.013 --> 11:22.556
Are you still human?

11:34.151 --> 11:35.611
Did you get the videos?

11:35.695 --> 11:38.072
Yes. Even from the streets nearby.

11:38.155 --> 11:39.907
Let's see.

11:40.533 --> 11:43.035
Hey, this is Detective Na Daesoo.

11:43.119 --> 11:44.078
Yes.

11:44.912 --> 11:46.247
Yes, what I asked for.

11:48.999 --> 11:49.959
Yes.

11:51.961 --> 11:53.129
Yeah. Where is that?

11:56.340 --> 11:57.341
Okay.

11:59.176 --> 12:00.344
So, 7-35?

12:00.428 --> 12:01.429
Yeah. Thank you.

12:01.512 --> 12:03.681
Uh, can you please head out there first?
We'll meet you.

12:03.764 --> 12:04.932
We'll be right behind you.

12:05.516 --> 12:06.517
Yes. Thank you.

12:07.184 --> 12:08.853
- Let's go.
- Where?

12:09.645 --> 12:12.148
Uh, three days ago, a retired doctor,

12:12.231 --> 12:14.233
treated a man in his 50's
with a stab wound.

12:14.817 --> 12:16.819
- Where did he treat him?
- Cheonwang Temple.

12:33.544 --> 12:34.879
Choi Mujin.

12:38.549 --> 12:40.050
Uh… Hey.

12:55.649 --> 12:58.110
COME IN ASAP
WE GOT CHOI MUJIN

13:24.470 --> 13:25.763
You did this.

13:42.071 --> 13:43.823
And Captain Cha Giho.

13:47.868 --> 13:48.994
Why did you do it?

13:51.247 --> 13:52.706
Why did you turn yourself in?

13:57.545 --> 13:59.505
Were you scared after stabbing a cop?

14:01.423 --> 14:03.342
Did you feel like it was over?

14:04.468 --> 14:06.637
There are many kinds of people
in this world.

14:10.224 --> 14:12.434
And every person thinks they're special.

14:18.649 --> 14:20.651
But if you take a closer look,

14:22.319 --> 14:24.363
they are only two categories.

14:27.658 --> 14:28.826
The predator…

14:31.036 --> 14:32.162
or the prey.

14:34.957 --> 14:36.750
You eat or get eaten.

14:38.919 --> 14:41.672
Cha Giho was prey
pretending to be a predator.

14:43.549 --> 14:45.009
So he won't live long.

14:52.850 --> 14:54.184
Which one are you?

14:56.812 --> 14:58.105
You're a murderer

14:58.772 --> 14:59.982
and a drug lord.

15:01.734 --> 15:04.111
You've done the most horrible things.

15:06.530 --> 15:08.073
And that's your excuse?

15:11.285 --> 15:13.662
You did all this
because you're a predator?

15:16.790 --> 15:18.334
What you've done is wrong.

15:21.170 --> 15:23.839
Think it over in solitary confinement.

15:25.674 --> 15:27.176
You'll have lots of time.

15:31.597 --> 15:32.640
Jeon.

15:33.432 --> 15:34.516
Pil.

15:35.893 --> 15:37.061
Do.

15:38.729 --> 15:40.230
You really think…

15:43.525 --> 15:44.944
I'm going away?

15:55.329 --> 15:56.789
Hey, Pildo.

15:56.872 --> 15:58.707
What is that asshole up to?

15:59.792 --> 16:02.461
We have to wait and see
if he's got something up his sleeve.

16:03.337 --> 16:05.965
That scumbag's done for
once Captain wakes up.

16:08.842 --> 16:09.843
Huh?

16:09.927 --> 16:11.053
Hold on. Excuse me.

16:12.846 --> 16:14.473
You won't be able to get out of this.

16:32.157 --> 16:33.993
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

16:36.662 --> 16:38.122
Hey.

16:38.205 --> 16:39.331
Where have you been?

16:43.752 --> 16:45.587
How did you end up catching him?

16:46.171 --> 16:47.506
He came in himself.

16:49.633 --> 16:52.386
Pildo is pressuring him
about the Do Gangjae case.

16:53.679 --> 16:55.055
I'll go in there with him.

17:13.782 --> 17:15.284
You turn yourself in?

17:19.246 --> 17:20.247
I…

17:20.998 --> 17:22.041
Please, sir.

17:25.502 --> 17:27.629
I came to prove that I am innocent.

17:48.859 --> 17:51.111
I never stabbed Do Gangjae.

17:54.907 --> 17:57.201
I never ordered Cha Giho's death either.

18:02.915 --> 18:04.625
Are you relying on him then?

18:06.668 --> 18:08.587
The mole you had among us all.

18:11.090 --> 18:13.425
The one who told you
about the cameras at the hotel

18:13.509 --> 18:15.344
and leaked investigation details.

18:15.427 --> 18:16.512
How loyal.

18:19.723 --> 18:22.392
Whoever that is,
it won't be able to get you out.

18:27.314 --> 18:29.650
I witnessed you stabbing Do Gangjae.

18:32.820 --> 18:34.780
We have your knife with your prints.

18:37.908 --> 18:39.243
They're all over it.

18:42.579 --> 18:44.081
There's no need to confess.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.127
HEAD OF LEGAL AFFAIRS
KANG SOOYEON

18:48.210 --> 18:50.045
We'll have the warrant in an hour.

18:57.553 --> 18:59.263
This time you're finished.

19:19.575 --> 19:20.742
Detective Oh.

19:21.910 --> 19:23.078
Leaving?

19:27.749 --> 19:29.376
Just going to my car.

19:29.459 --> 19:30.836
I left something.

19:32.504 --> 19:34.631
The mole? How did you know?

19:37.467 --> 19:39.011
I was giving him a test.

19:40.345 --> 19:42.014
I had to see if he had someone.

19:46.143 --> 19:47.686
So is there a mole?

19:49.062 --> 19:50.105
We're speculating.

19:50.814 --> 19:52.524
I couldn't identify him yet.

19:54.276 --> 19:56.403
Be quick. We got to work.

19:59.948 --> 20:00.949
Pildo.

20:07.164 --> 20:08.332
Thank you.

20:11.835 --> 20:13.754
You need to answer my calls.

20:14.338 --> 20:16.924
Whatever the situation is,
you answer my calls.

20:33.899 --> 20:35.067
- Daesoo.
- Hey.

20:35.150 --> 20:36.276
We found him.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.402
What?

20:47.996 --> 20:51.375
That car arrived and left
around the time the Captain was attacked.

20:51.458 --> 20:52.417
That one?

20:56.922 --> 20:58.507
- I'll look up the plates.
- Okay.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.467
Follow him. See where he went.

21:11.353 --> 21:12.646
What is it?

21:12.729 --> 21:14.189
Oh, yes. Hello.

21:15.315 --> 21:16.817
- Captain Cha…
- Yeah?

21:16.900 --> 21:18.568
Requested this be turn over to you.

21:19.903 --> 21:20.988
What is it?

21:21.738 --> 21:24.992
He said to give it to you
if anything were to happen to him.

21:27.119 --> 21:28.912
PHONE CALL RECORDS

21:29.788 --> 21:32.165
CORPORAL OH HYEJIN OF NARCOTICS

21:33.375 --> 21:34.626
Uh… Well, thank you.

21:34.710 --> 21:35.669
Sure.

21:45.804 --> 21:51.018
EVIDENCE STORAGE

21:53.270 --> 21:55.355
Hi. Can I help you
with something?

21:56.690 --> 21:58.317
I'm here to check some evidence, please.

21:58.900 --> 22:00.110
Oh. Sure.

22:18.795 --> 22:21.631
You're looking for evidence
for Do Gangjae's murder case, right?

22:24.092 --> 22:25.302
Yeah, that's right.

22:26.178 --> 22:30.140
Shit. I can't find this car. 60K 8640?

22:30.223 --> 22:31.433
Yes, that's right.

22:33.852 --> 22:35.228
I think it's a fake plate.

22:35.854 --> 22:36.855
What?

22:43.820 --> 22:46.406
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY
EMERGENCY CONTACT LIST

22:46.990 --> 22:48.075
60K 8640

22:48.158 --> 22:49.159
Hang on.

22:50.452 --> 22:53.121
OH HYEJIN, CORPORAL

23:00.087 --> 23:01.838
Please return it by 6:00 p.m.

23:17.020 --> 23:19.856
7-35, CHEONWANGSAN-RO, BUK-GU, INCHANG

23:22.776 --> 23:24.986
No one has come here
in a long while.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.831
Hey, where's Detective Oh?

23:35.914 --> 23:37.499
You really need to come and look at this.

23:50.804 --> 23:52.514
I removed the evidence.

23:56.268 --> 23:57.352
Okay.

24:23.378 --> 24:25.505
Stop Detective Oh Hyejin
from leaving the building.

24:25.589 --> 24:27.174
- This is the control room.
- Yes. Okay.

24:27.257 --> 24:28.633
Report to the control room immediately

24:28.717 --> 24:30.093
if you spot Corporal Oh Hyejin.

24:30.177 --> 24:33.513
Corporal Oh Hyejin
of the Drug Investigation Unit…

24:33.597 --> 24:35.515
Corporal Oh Hyejin
of the Drug Investigation…

24:36.099 --> 24:37.851
The evidence won't be a problem for us.

24:40.770 --> 24:41.730
Yes.

24:42.939 --> 24:46.359
I'll tell you all the details later
when we meet up in person.

24:58.747 --> 25:00.582
She went to the evidence room.

25:00.665 --> 25:02.918
She took evidence
from the Do Gangjae case.

25:14.804 --> 25:16.389
She went by the back door.

25:16.473 --> 25:17.557
The back door!

25:34.866 --> 25:36.451
Unit, close the gate!

25:39.371 --> 25:40.205
Stop!

25:48.338 --> 25:50.423
We're not done questioning you!

25:50.507 --> 25:51.591
Choi Mujin!

25:55.679 --> 25:58.181
There is no reason
for my client to be here any longer.

25:58.974 --> 26:00.809
Call me if you find the evidence.

26:00.892 --> 26:01.977
But I will claim

26:02.727 --> 26:04.646
that the evidence has been tampered with.

26:17.409 --> 26:18.868
Did you find Hyejin?

26:18.952 --> 26:21.079
No. I'm sorry, sir.

26:36.511 --> 26:39.055
Are you saying
she joined our team on purpose

26:39.139 --> 26:42.267
to get information
and take the Captain out?

26:43.560 --> 26:45.270
Hey, Gunpyeong. Get her…

26:47.147 --> 26:48.106
No.

26:48.690 --> 26:50.358
Take her things and run her prints.

26:50.442 --> 26:51.276
What?

26:51.359 --> 26:54.112
Oh Hyejin
isn't actually Oh Hyejin!

26:55.405 --> 26:57.282
That can't be her real name, right?

26:58.575 --> 27:01.036
Shit.

27:01.911 --> 27:04.164
Hey, Pildo! Snap out of it!

27:04.247 --> 27:05.832
We have to catch her, asshole!

27:05.915 --> 27:07.125
Stop it. That's enough.

27:07.208 --> 27:09.336
- Calm down.
- We have to catch her and ask

27:09.419 --> 27:11.379
why she stabbed the Captain!

27:12.380 --> 27:13.298
Damn it!

27:25.143 --> 27:26.770
Because dangerous assholes have a new drug

27:26.853 --> 27:28.188
and no one is investigating.

27:28.772 --> 27:29.898
Is that all?

27:29.981 --> 27:31.399
Four people died…

27:33.735 --> 27:36.071
if the two gangs collide, more will die.

27:37.113 --> 27:38.573
Do they kill Choi Mujin?

27:41.493 --> 27:42.744
Was it all…

27:44.454 --> 27:46.039
Was all that a lie?

27:50.752 --> 27:52.587
CHOI MUJIN

27:56.383 --> 27:57.842
Because you're one of them?

28:08.853 --> 28:11.314
Was Detective Oh your friend's daughter?

28:12.399 --> 28:15.443
The one you requested the passport for.

28:16.986 --> 28:17.987
Mm-hm.

28:19.447 --> 28:21.491
Did you turn yourself in then

28:22.158 --> 28:23.535
to give her a test?

28:25.704 --> 28:27.163
I had to be certain.

28:30.709 --> 28:32.669
It would be a waste to kill her.

28:35.630 --> 28:36.881
I'm surprised.

28:37.966 --> 28:40.510
She'll be a fugitive
now that she's exposed,

28:40.593 --> 28:42.345
but she's willing to go this far.

28:43.680 --> 28:45.890
How did you convince her
to do this for you?

28:57.277 --> 28:58.570
I tricked her.

29:58.213 --> 29:59.964
I choose to trust Detective Oh.

30:00.048 --> 30:01.508
Pildo!

30:47.554 --> 30:49.639
She got me out to kill me.

30:53.685 --> 30:55.186
I'm giving you my dagger.

30:59.232 --> 31:01.150
You kill him as soon as you can.

31:22.088 --> 31:23.464
Taeju, come here.

31:23.548 --> 31:25.425
- Come here.
- Take one with us.

31:38.146 --> 31:40.315
We'll go and get rid
of that bitch for you, sir.

31:44.694 --> 31:45.987
Where is she gone?

31:49.824 --> 31:50.867
We'll wait.

31:53.119 --> 31:54.579
She'll come on her own.

32:04.756 --> 32:06.466
Her only life goal…

32:08.635 --> 32:09.802
is me.

32:13.598 --> 32:16.267
My dad and I used to talk about
building a beach house

32:16.351 --> 32:17.644
and live in there.

32:19.187 --> 32:21.898
And I always wonder
if he were still alive now…

32:25.735 --> 32:27.570
would we be able to live like that?

33:42.562 --> 33:48.317
PUREUNSOL MEMORIAL PARK

33:50.737 --> 33:53.406
PUREUNSOL MEMORIAL PARK
MAINTENANCE RECEIPT

33:53.489 --> 33:55.491
NEXT OF KIN: SONG JOONSU

33:56.075 --> 33:57.994
RECIPIENT: CHA GIHO

34:05.001 --> 34:05.835
Hey.

34:05.918 --> 34:08.171
Pildo. I just heard back.

34:09.380 --> 34:12.216
Her prints… they aren't in the system.

34:12.300 --> 34:13.760
That fucking bitch.

34:14.594 --> 34:17.263
She didn't even register her fingerprints.

34:18.473 --> 34:21.267
That means Dongcheon
bred her meticulously.

34:21.976 --> 34:23.311
It's a mess in here.

34:23.811 --> 34:25.605
Pildo. Get over here.

34:25.688 --> 34:28.691
DO NOT ENTER
UNDER INVESTIGATION

35:03.226 --> 35:06.729
DECEASED, KIM JEONGA

35:17.073 --> 35:18.574
I'm sorry, Papa.

35:20.785 --> 35:23.287
I didn't know how you had been living.

35:27.792 --> 35:30.002
If I had I wouldn't have resented you.

35:32.130 --> 35:33.881
I would've hugged you instead.

35:36.759 --> 35:39.554
It must have been so lonely
and exhausting.

35:41.931 --> 35:44.100
I think I can understand you now.

35:47.728 --> 35:48.938
I miss you,

35:49.856 --> 35:50.940
Papa.

36:05.246 --> 36:06.497
Oh, hey.

36:07.498 --> 36:09.167
What is all this, huh?

36:09.250 --> 36:11.002
What happened in this place?

36:11.085 --> 36:12.378
Damn.

36:12.461 --> 36:13.421
Everything's gone.

36:14.672 --> 36:15.923
No one's here.

36:16.716 --> 36:20.261
Maybe Choi Mujin got rid of her
and already cleared the place out.

36:21.095 --> 36:22.096
Oh, shit.

36:27.935 --> 36:29.812
Tonight's not good…

36:34.233 --> 36:36.235
DECEASED, KIM JEONGA

36:37.278 --> 36:38.863
I'll be back for you.

36:41.115 --> 36:42.200
Watch me.

36:44.118 --> 36:45.828
And see what happens.

37:52.228 --> 37:53.521
Hey, stop!

37:56.482 --> 37:57.400
Turn around.

38:01.696 --> 38:03.114
Don't test me anymore.

38:05.449 --> 38:07.201
You've toyed with me enough.

38:18.379 --> 38:19.505
Hands up.

38:33.269 --> 38:37.189
You're under arrest for obstruction
of justice and attempted murder.

38:40.151 --> 38:42.862
You have the right to an attorney.

38:42.945 --> 38:45.072
You may testify on your own behalf.

38:45.823 --> 38:48.868
You may challenge
the properness of arrest.

38:51.704 --> 38:56.334
A SAFE AND CLEAN CITY FULL OF HOPE

39:23.736 --> 39:25.571
- Damn it.
- No, sir.

39:25.654 --> 39:27.573
Let go. Shit.

39:27.656 --> 39:28.908
I considered her a colleague.

39:28.991 --> 39:30.451
Hey. Look up.

39:30.534 --> 39:31.869
Hey, you…

39:31.952 --> 39:33.954
Your life is over, asshole.

39:34.038 --> 39:35.748
You traitor bitch.

39:35.831 --> 39:36.874
Shit.

39:38.417 --> 39:40.419
Let go! Let go of me!

39:51.555 --> 39:53.224
Can we get her out?

39:53.307 --> 39:56.977
She stole evidence from the police agency
and was caught on camera.

39:57.561 --> 39:58.771
There's no way.

39:58.854 --> 39:59.855
Get her out.

40:00.523 --> 40:02.191
In case she confesses?

40:03.067 --> 40:04.276
She won't do that.

40:05.653 --> 40:07.696
She's probably waiting for me now.

40:08.447 --> 40:11.659
You said she killed Mr. Jung
and will come to kill you too.

40:12.827 --> 40:15.329
Are you saying you'll make her come?

40:32.263 --> 40:33.556
Give us some privacy.

40:33.639 --> 40:34.765
Yes, sir.

40:46.902 --> 40:48.904
The Captain was suspicious of you.

40:50.364 --> 40:51.740
So you stabbed him?

40:52.825 --> 40:54.785
So he wouldn't expose your identity?

41:00.082 --> 41:01.584
Why did you thank me?

41:04.128 --> 41:05.713
For being fooled by you?

41:07.756 --> 41:08.799
Tell me.

41:10.593 --> 41:13.137
Make an excuse. Lie. Say something!

41:19.852 --> 41:21.187
I trusted you.

41:25.232 --> 41:27.067
I didn't stab the Captain.

41:36.285 --> 41:37.703
If I'm honest,

41:41.123 --> 41:42.500
would you believe me?

41:57.097 --> 41:58.182
No, I can't.

41:58.974 --> 41:59.934
Forget it.

42:24.750 --> 42:27.169
OH HYEJIN

42:42.351 --> 42:43.310
Your name.

42:46.981 --> 42:48.148
What's your name?

42:56.615 --> 42:58.200
What's your actual name?
